  "instructions": [
    "Grind the beef to a fine consistency using a meat grinder or a food processor.",
    "Transfer the ground beef to a bowl and mix in the olive oil, red wine vinegar, Dijon mustard, pickled mustard seeds, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Season the beef mixture with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Using a sashimi knife, cut the beef mixture into thin slices and place on a serving plate.",
    "Drizzle the truffle oil over the beef slices.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and chives.",
    "Serve the beef slices on toasted brioche with a quail egg on top.",
    "Garnish with watercress and serve immediately.",
    "To assemble the dish, slice the toasted brioche into quarters and top each quarter with a beef slice, a quail egg, and a sprinkle of watercress.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
